      "title": "Chrome adds Gemini-powered autofill to suggest form data from Gmail",
      "summary": "Google expanded Chrome's enhanced autofill to pull information directly from Gmail using Gemini with Personal Intelligence. Starting today, the browser suggests data found across inbox emails to help users fill out web forms.",
