        "Gemini with Personal Intelligence extracts form suggestions from Gmail messages.",
        "Rollout begins today across Chrome's enhanced autofill feature.",
        "Expands existing autofill beyond Google Accounts and Google Wallet data."
      ],
      "design_implication": "A designer building multi-step onboarding or checkout forms traditionally assumes users must copy-paste details from external confirmation emails. With browsers pulling context directly from inbox threads into form fields, design reviews must focus on verifying inferred values and handling misattributed email snippets rather than friction-heavy manual entry. Audit complex forms to display explicit provenance tags and clear edit states when fields are populated automatically by browser agents.",
